OL,3,GNEWSASister condemns 'sickening' racist
OL,4,Aattack on siblings
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sister of two people injured in a
OL,7,Fracially-motivated attack in
OL,8,FLondonderry has described the ordeal as
OL,9,F"sickening", saying it has left their
OL,10,Ffamily deeply shaken.
OL,12,FThe woman said her brother and sister
OL,13,Fwere subjected to racial abuse before
OL,14,Fbeing attacked by a group of men, one
OL,15,Fof whom was armed with a baton.
OL,17,FPolice said they are investigating
OL,18,Fthree assaults and criminal damage in
OL,19,Fthe Waterside area of the city on
OL,20,FSunday night.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
