OL,3,GNEWSASister condemns 'sickening' racist
OL,4,Aattack on siblings
OL,5,
OL,6,FSupt Sinead McIldowney said there was
OL,7,F"no place in our city for this shameful
OL,8,Ftype of behaviour". Police believe all
OL,9,Fthree incidents may be linked and are
OL,10,Ftreating them as racially-motivated
OL,11,Fhate crimes.
